Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?fix(auth):=20reactivar=20alta=20self-servic?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20del=20due=C3=B1o=20de=20cl=C3=ADnica=20(F7-11b)?=
